{title: 587 - In Christ There Is No East nor West}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #587 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 587}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gm]In [Eb/Bb]Christ [Bb]there [Ab]is [Bb]no east [Bb7]nor [Eb/Bb]west,
[Eb/Bb]In [Fm/C]Him no [Eb/Bb]south [Ab]or [Eb/Bb]north;
[Eb]But [Ab]one [Eb/Bb]great [Cm]fellowship [Fm]oflove
[Eb/G]Throughout the [Fm/Ab]whole [Bb7/F]wide [Cm/G]earth.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Gm]In Him [Eb/Bb]shall [Bb]true [Ab]heart [Bb]everywhere
[Eb/Bb]Their [Fm/C]high communion [Eb/Bb]find;
[Eb]His [Ab]service [Cm]is [Eb]the [Bb/F]golden [Eb]cord
[Eb/G]Close binding [Cm/G]all [Bb7/F]mankind.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Gm]Join [Eb/Bb]hands, [Bb]then, [Ab]brothers [Bb]of [Bb7]the [Eb/Bb]faith,
[Eb/Bb]Whate'er [Fm/C]your [Eb/Bb]race [Ab]may [Eb/Bb]be.
[Eb]Who serves my [Cm]Father [Bb/F]as [Fm]a [Eb]son
[Eb/G]Is surely [Cm/G]kin [Bb7/F]to [Cm/G]me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Gm]In [Eb/Bb]Christ [Bb]now [Ab]meet [Bb]both east [Bb7]and [Eb/Bb]west,
[Eb/Bb]In [Fm/C]Him meet [Eb/Bb]south [Ab]and [Eb/Bb]north;
[Eb]All [Ab]Christly [Cm]souls [Eb]are [Bb/F]one [Fm]in [Eb]Him
[Eb/G]Throughout the [Fm/Ab]whole [Bb7/F]wide [Cm/G]earth.
{end_of_verse}
